'''''Quercus orocantabrica''''', the '''Cantabrian mountain oak''', is a [[species]] of [[deciduous]] [[oak]].<ref name="inaturalist-Quercus orocantabrica">{{cite web |title=Cantabrian Mountain Oak (Quercus orocantabrica) |url=https://inaturalist.ca/taxa/635285-Quercus-orocantabrica |website=iNaturalist Canada |access-date=2023-12-23 |language=en}}</ref> It occurs in the [[Cantabrian Mountains]] of northwestern Spain and northern Portugal.

